[6468]={"Deviate Scale Belt",3,18,23,"Q","Wailing Caverns","Deviate Eradication",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Deviate Eradication'. Starts with Ebru at the Wailing Caverns entrance in the Barrens. Objective: Kill 7 Deviate Ravagers, 7 Deviate Vipers, 7 Deviate Shamblers and 7 Deviate Dreadfangs. Ebru offers a choice of Pattern: Deviate Scale Belt, Sizzle Stick, or Dagmire Gauntlets. The belt is crafted afterwards."},
