[6966]={"Elunite Axe",2,10,15,"Q","Darnassus","Weapons of Elunite",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Elunite'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mathiel in Darnassus. Objective: &lt;name&gt;, I have crafted these weapons with the elunite you brought to me. &nbsp;Please, take whichever most suits you.And I must thank you. &nbsp;Working with elunite is both an honor and a pleasure."},
