[7115]={"Heirloom Axe",2,10,15,"Q","Tirisfal Glades","Heirloom Weapon",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Heirloom Weapon'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Coleman Farthing in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: I will keep three of the weapons you returned to me, as mementos of my pain and loss. &nbsp;But please, &lt;name&gt;, choose your favorite of the heirlooms and keep it for yourself.May it serve you greater than it served its cursed, former owners."},
