[7129]={"Brutal Gauntlets",2,20,31,"Q","Durotar","Brutal Gauntlets",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Brutal Gauntlets'. Starts with Ula'elek in Durotar. Objective: Thank you, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;These gauntlets are my best work. &nbsp;Take them. In wearing them, you bring honor to me and my ancestors. Quest chain: Speak with Ruga > Trial at the Field of Giants > ... 4 more ... > Brutal Gauntlets."},
[7130]={"Brutal Helm",2,20,31,"Q","Thunder Bluff","Brutal Helm",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Brutal Helm'. Quest chain: Speak with Ruga > Trial at the Field of Giants > ... 4 more ... > Brutal Helm."},
[7132]={"Brutal Legguards",2,20,29,"Q","Undercity","Brutal Legguards",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Brutal Legguards'. Starts with Velora Nitely in Undercity. Objective: Here are your legguards, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;Let me know how they fit or if you need any modifications. &nbsp;I aim to please! &nbsp;At least I used to.These days I don't care much for my craft. &nbsp;But it beats being a mindless minion of the Scourge!I guess. Quest chain: Speak with Ruga > Trial at the Field of Giants > ... 4 more ... > Brutal Legguards."},
[7133]={"Brutal Hauberk",3,20,30,"Q","The Barrens","Brutal Hauberk",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Brutal Hauberk'. Starts with Thun'grim Firegaze in The Barrens. Objective: I am sure you endured much hardship and shed much blood on my task, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;Here is the product of your toil.May you wear it well, and may you one day return here with stories of its service to you. Quest chain: Speak with Ruga > Trial at the Field of Giants > Speak with Thun'grim > Brutal Armor > Brutal Hauberk."},
