[9520]={"Silent Hunter",2,30,41,"Q","Arathi Highlands","Call to Arms",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Call to Arms'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Drum Fel in Arathi Highlands. Objective: Kill 10 Boulderfist Brutes and 4 Boulderfist Magi, and return to Drum Fel in the Hammerfall outpost. Quest chain: The Hammer May Fall > Call to Arms > Call to Arms > Call to Arms."},
