[10328]={"Scarlet Chestpiece",3,34,39,"T","Scarlet Monastery","Scarlet Champion",nil,"Drops from Scarlet Champion. Set piece of Chain of the Scarlet Crusade (Scarlet Monastery). (2) +10 Shadow Resistance. (3) +30 Attack Power against Undead. (4) Taking damage can grant Enraging Light for 10 sec, adding 20 Holy to each melee attack, 60 against Undead. (5) +1% hit. (6) At 20% health, absorb 480 damage for 10 sec, once every 4 min. For Retribution, the belt is a hunt from 32 to 36, the chest from 34 to 39, and the legs at 39. The gauntlets sit in the top 3 at 33 and 34. For Protection, the boots are a hunt from 30 to 36, the bracers from 31 to 35, and the chest from 34 to 39."},
