[13982]={"Warblade of Caer Darrow",3,57,63,"Q","Scholomance","The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper",nil,"Reward from the quest 'The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Magistrate Marduke in Western Plaguelands. Objective: Find Ras Frostwhisper in the Scholomance. When you have found him, use the Soulbound Keepsake on his undead visage. Should you succeed in reverting him to a mortal, strike him down and recover the Human Head of Ras Frostwhisper. Take the head back to Magistrate Marduke. Quest chain: Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher > Krastinov's Bag of Horrors > ... 6 more ... > The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper."},
