[15801]={"Valiant Shortsword",2,50,58,"Q","Western Plaguelands","Mission Accomplished!",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Mission Accomplished!'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with High Executor Derrington in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: &lt;name&gt;, your successful re-engineering of the cauldrons is a tremendous victory for us!Let all within my presence hear: for service to the Forsaken and to the Horde as a whole above and beyond what was expected - in the face of overwhelming odds and incredible danger, might I add - I give &lt;name&gt; this, and I extend upon him our undying gratitude as a true hero of the Horde. &nbsp;Huzzah!"},
