[15804]={"Cerise Drape",2,51,56,"Q","Western Plaguelands","Glyphed Oaken Branch",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Glyphed Oaken Branch'. Starts with Mulgris Deepriver in Darnassus. Objective: Based on the magic enchanted within the Glyphed Oaken Branch, its delivery to the Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is the next step the tauren druid sought. Seek one of the druids there for assistance."},
[15805]={"Penelope's Rose",3,55,61,"Q","Scholomance","Kirtonos the Herald",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Kirtonos the Herald'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Eva Sarkhoff in Scholomance. Objective: Return to the Scholomance with the Blood of Innocents. Find the porch and place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier. Kirtonos will come to feast upon your soul.Fight valiantly, do not give an inch! Destroy Kirtonos and return to Eva Sarkhoff. Quest chain: Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher > Krastinov's Bag of Horrors > Kirtonos the Herald."},
[15806]={"Mirah's Song",3,55,61,"Q","Scholomance","Kirtonos the Herald",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Kirtonos the Herald'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Eva Sarkhoff in Scholomance. Objective: Return to the Scholomance with the Blood of Innocents. Find the porch and place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier. Kirtonos will come to feast upon your soul.Fight valiantly, do not give an inch! Destroy Kirtonos and return to Eva Sarkhoff. Quest chain: Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher > Krastinov's Bag of Horrors > Kirtonos the Herald."},
