[17768]={"Woodseed Hoop",2,41,49,"Q","Maraudon","Vyletongue Corruption",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Vyletongue Corruption'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vark Battlescar in Maraudon. Objective: Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon.Use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge.Heal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Vark Battlescar in Shadowprey Village."},
