[18807]={"Helm of Latent Power",3,58,62,"Q","Orgrimmar","The Darkreaver Menace",nil,"Reward from the quest 'The Darkreaver Menace'. Starts with Sagorne Creststrider in Orgrimmar. Objective: Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him.Bring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar. Quest chain: Material Assistance > The Darkreaver Menace."},
