[19037]={"Emerald Peak Spaulders",2,39,48,"Q","Feralas","Zukk'ash Report",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Zukk'ash Report'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Hadoken Swiftstrider in Orgrimmar. Objective: Deliver the Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report to Zilzibin Drumlore. He resides in the Drag of Orgrimmar."},
