[20082]={"Woestave",3,50,52,"Q","Felwood","Blood of Morphaz",nil,"Reward from the quest 'Blood of Morphaz'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ogtinc in Felwood. Objective: Kill Morphaz in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar, and return his blood to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood. The entrance to the sunken temple can be found in the Swamp of Sorrows. Quest chain: Cenarion Aid > Of Coursers We Know > The Ichor of Undeath > Blood of Morphaz."},
[20083]={"Hunting Spear",3,50,52,"Q","Azshara","The Green Drake",nil,"Reward from the quest 'The Green Drake'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ogtinc in Azshara. Objective: Bring the Tooth of Morphaz to Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath. Quest chain: The Hunter's Charm > Courser Antlers > Wavethrashing > The Green Drake."},
